# Cloudflare Pages redirects/rewrites.
# Per-workout / per-program detail pages are generated as static files at
# build time (workouts/<slug>.html, programs/<slug>.html); static files take
# precedence, so the rewrites below only catch unknown slugs, serving the
# generic detail pages (which read the slug from the URL path) as a fallback.
# (Rewriting to the extensionless /workout and /program avoids Cloudflare's
# .html -> pretty-URL 308, which would strip the slug from the address bar.)
/workouts/*  /workout  200
/programs/*  /program  200

# Removed pages (301 to home so old links don't 404).
/why-kohlrabi  /  301
/why-kohlrabi.html  /  301
